Patch 004 [tailquant]: router-frequency profiler (env-gated, zero-cost when unset).

Harvests per-layer expert-hit histograms from live topk_ids at every MoE
application. This is the data prerequisite for TailQuant mixed-precision expert
requantization (collab-work/tailquant/DESIGN.md): precision follows measured
routing frequency. Flushes router_hist.json every 65k tokens to
$VLLM_TAILQUANT_PROFILE_DIR. Covers the MarlinExperts.apply dense-batch path
(V1 runner); batched/micro-kernel paths unhooked in v1.

Target: glm52-spark-kit overlay file marlin_moe.py (apply AFTER baking overlays).
